<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`OBJECT_RETURN_PARCEL: number = 1`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer OBJECT_RETURN_PARCEL = 1;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant OBJECT_RETURN_PARCEL has the value 1</p>
  <p>For llReturnObjectsByOwner, sets the scope to return all objects on the same parcel as the script which are owned by 'owner'. The script must be owned by an estate manager or over a parcel owned by the owner of the script.</p>
</p>
